# Where the contact form posts its FormData; it must answer with a 2xx status.
# Fields: name, email, topic, message, consent, lang. Drop submissions with a non-empty
# `website` field: it is a spam trap that people never see.
# Copy to .env and uncomment. Leave it out (not empty) when there is no endpoint yet.
# PUBLIC_CONTACT_ENDPOINT=https://example.com/contact
